            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.23.5+LEV.23.6+LEV.23.7+LEV.23.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 23.5-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.28.16+NUM.28.17+NUM.28.18+NUM.28.19+NUM.28.20+NUM.28.21+NUM.28.22+NUM.28.23+NUM.28.24+NUM.28.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 28.16-25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Mbung'a olapa le Abibu nimbung Sabato o Laitoriani Enkai ino; amu to lapa le Abibu apa kintayio Olaitoriani Enkai ino aitung'uaa enkop e Misiri kewarie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipolosaki iyie olasar le pasaka Olaitoriani Enkai ino, too ntare aashu too nkishu, teine wueji negelu Olaitoriani pee eitamany enkarna enye ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mipudaki iyie imukateni naaisuishieki, nkolong'i naapishana iyie inosa tenebo imukateni neitu eisuishieki ina mukate o sina - amu itupukutuo apa intae te nkop e Misiri te nkisikata e nkisarrisar - pee itumutumu aatayiolo too nkolong'i pooki enkishui inyi ina olong apa nitupukutuo aaing'uaa enkop e Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emincho edoli emukate naisuishieki tiatua enkop inyi too nkolong'i naapishana; niminchosho nena kiri o lasar le teipa teina olong e dukuya ekenyiki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mindimidimi aatopolos olasar le pasaka tiatua pooki ake ninye ang inyi naisho intae Olaitoriani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kake teine wueji negelu Olaitoriani Enkai inyi pee eitamany enkarna enye ine, teine iyie shomo intayu olasar le pasaka, teipa edoyio enkolong, teina kata apa nitupukutuo aaing'uaa Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyier aitokitokie ninos teine wueji negelu Olaitoriani Enkai ino; ore tadekenya nimbelekenyanya aapuo ilng'oborri linyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too nkolong'i ile ninosinoso imukateni neitu eisuishieki ore te nkolong e naapishana naa keaku eneumata o Laitoriani Enkai inyi; miasiasa esiai teina olong.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Osirua le nkisampuare",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
